## Command

```shell
biome lint --write --unsafe --only=nursery/useTailwindSortedClasses '<TEMP_DIR>/use_tailwind_sorted_classes_reads_package_imports'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "tailwind": { "stylesheet": "./src/app.css" },
  "linter": { "rules": { "nursery": { "useTailwindSortedClasses": "error" } } }
}
```

